Place TLS material here (gitignored contents).

docker-compose.prod.yml mounts this directory read-only at
/etc/nginx/certs, and deploy/nginx.https.conf expects:

    fullchain.pem   leaf + intermediate(s)
    privkey.pem     private key, chmod 600

Both are produced by certbot (see `make certs` and
docs/deployment.md). They are gitignored: a private key in version
control is a compromised key, and removing it from history afterwards
does not undo the fact that it was published.
